  "description": "This is the campus radio station of bikes. Genre bending and category defying, the Projekt 24 tackles your morning dash to work or class, your nighttime pub crawl, and all your weekend adventures. This bike won't hold you back, with a light, fast aluminum frame (in a men's and ladies' configuration) and a big range of gears that let you explore any road. High quality specs like mechanical disc brakes, alloy bars, an adjustable stem, double-wall rims and stainless spokes keep the Projekt 24 light, durable, comfortable and versatile.\nCustom D-Street alloy frameset\nShimano 24 speed Altus derailleurs with EZ Fire shifters\nShimano TY301 crankset\nTektro MD-280 mechanical disc brakes\nLightweight alloy 31.8mm handlebar & stem\nFast-rolling and durable 700x35c tires\nSturdy 32 hole alloy wheelset with doublewall rims",
